<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11757] Missed partitions during rebalancing when new blank node joins</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11757</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Please take a look at newly added test&lt;br/&gt;
GridCachePartitionedSupplyEventsSelfTest.testSupplyEvents&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There&apos;s logging of missed partitions during rebalancing, and as you can see partitions are missed even when a new node joins stable topology, with no nodes leaving.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Expected behavior is that in this case no partitions will be missed.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
